      "volume_part": "",
      "volume_verified": false,
      "structural_volume_verified": true,
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "六月庚子，徐達朝行在。甲辰，海南、海北諸道降。壬戌，楊璟、朱亮祖克靖江。",
